{"parse": {"title": "NS-15", "pageid": 25791, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/NS-14\" title=\"NS-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">NS-15</span><a href=\"/wiki/NS-16\" title=\"NS-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">NS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A9.BA.E5.BF.83.E7.9C.BC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"空心眼\">空心眼</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 空心眼</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Hollow Eyed</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>真<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>倒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>外<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1610115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_jiaowai\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_jiaowai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红鬃的“斑纹马”驮着别斯米尔冲进急雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它一路狂奔，似乎恐惧于身后可能的追捕，也为了防止背上的人在减速中跳下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>停——停下——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>——你能听见吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马只是继续向前奔跑。它甚至轻松地越过几处凹陷的浅滩，继续往前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人的语言无用，别斯米尔试图按照驯马的方式让它减速。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深呼吸之后，她松开一开始就紧紧抓住的，作为着力点的鬃毛，改为一只手扶在颈脖之前，另一只手则在奔跑的节奏中一下一下抚摸它两旁的皮毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>放松……放松……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-619916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-619916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-619916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>好孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>呼——呼——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深呼吸之后，她抓住这机会从马背上翻身，摔了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>别斯米尔“如愿”跌在浅滩里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>呃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-621812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-621812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-621812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斑纹马？：</div><div>咴——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>嘶呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-621801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-621801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-621801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斑纹马？：</div><div>咴！咴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马停在了不远处，而且正在掉头回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顾不上新伤旧伤叠加，别斯米尔从水泊中爬起来，手却陷入了浅滩柔软的泥土里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不像沼泽那般黏着，也同样让她一时无法站立。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斑纹马？：</div><div>别斯米尔女士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>是你吗？小叶尼塞？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-619911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>你在哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的声音近在咫尺，别斯米尔却无论如何也摸索不到准确的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她努力将自己从泥地中撑起，又再次跌下去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>对不起，您摔伤了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>是我太着急了，我们不能被追上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>还好。还好——你是怎么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我现在是在水里和您说话，您快回到我的背上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……你也变成了斑纹马？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>难道说，这是你的神秘术……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>女士，这不是斑纹马，这是鹿蜀！虽然都是神秘动物，但不一样——哦，是的，这是我的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我能通过水中显影传声，经过图拉的沼泽时，您曾经见过的，记得吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>那“鹿蜀”呢？鹿蜀是什么？是“葛天”把你带走了，变成这样——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被带走前听到的陌生名词突兀地出现在脑海中，别斯米尔很快将它与现状关联起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>雨太大了，我听不见后面的声音，也听不清您——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>您快上来吧！我不确定他们离这儿还有多远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>我还没有听见成年人的脚步声。孩子，你得过来些，拉我一把。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小叶尼塞于是跨得更近过去，把别斯米尔从下陷的浅滩中拱出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-619916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-619916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-619916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>谢谢。所以究竟发生了什么……？我们遇到的情况似乎越来越复杂了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我们弄错了。葛天并没有对我下手，与此相反，恰恰是他救了我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>那是谁？是谁能把你变成这样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……昨晚您没有喝水，对吗？在您上楼之后，我与曲娘在楼下闲谈，还喝了不少她赠予的水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>这就是差别。葛天说曲娘的神秘术就在酒或者水这类液体之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-619912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-619912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-619912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>天哪，孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>在那之后，我也来到楼上。您大概是累极了，睡得很安稳，可我却一点也睡不着，只好再次下楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>就在下楼的途中，我听见了歌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>那是一首……我从没听过的歌。歌词我也无法理解，只记得旋律轻柔，还有些奇特——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>直到我发现这首歌是一群木头人在唱。那是一群很小的，会融化在酒水中的木头人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小叶尼塞把那段惊吓的旅程从头脑中掘起，又努力用平静的语气讲述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>而且，院子里的马，好像也在随木头人哼唱旋律。它有红色的鬃毛和尾巴，就像我现在的样子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>现在我知道，原来那就是鹿蜀。它的斑纹，会在月光下泛着银光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>可是，昨晚你们在楼下时，你没有看到那只鹿蜀长什么样吗？                  </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>说实话，我没有仔细看。上楼之前，我和曲娘甚至聊得……聊得很好。当时一切都很让人安心，我不明白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>那为什么——为什么尤利恩先生他们变成的动物，和你不一样？你只说过他们有斑纹不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>的确不一样。关于这个，我有一些猜想，但现在还没办法确证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-619913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>什么样的猜想？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>倒影中的小叶尼塞也沉默了，片刻后才回答了别斯米尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>曲娘后院打水的地方，正靠近城内母河的支流。或许我们遇上的，是它的下游，活水又分割了滞留其中的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>通常情况下，活水就像自足的聚落，会自发排斥外来者的痕迹，就连我也被拒斥过许多次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>尤利恩先生他们的情况，或许只是神秘术施展不完全而导致的意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>那职祠中那些其他的斑纹马，难道也是——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_shuizhongdaoying3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……也许曲娘根本就没有意识到，她所释放的神秘术，以残余的形态流入了河中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>而我饮用的，则是她亲手所制的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人都陷入了难堪的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>唉……那么葛天又是怎样出现的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>就在昨晚，在他打退突然开始围攻我的木头小人之后。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_jiaowai\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_jiaowai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_jiaowai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>重新拾起的回忆话题，被急雨骤停打断，小叶尼塞抬起头去确认落雨的情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雨真的停了。这也意味着她们需要去往其他地方，以免被找到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>雨停了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>女士，我们得换个安全的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>不，孩子，我不明白葛天为什么唯独把你带走。如果当时我也在那里呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我只知道，他当时就是为了来带走我们两个，他是来救我们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>而且现在葛天已经负伤了。在职祠时，他一直没有出手还击，我怀疑有什么原因让他不能伤害那些人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>如果这是真的，那我们得去救他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>你突然这样相信他，是不是因为他还做了些什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>按照现在的情况，在我看来，他们全都不对劲。葛天是，里正和曲娘也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>女士，请相信我。我曾经也这样觉得，他或许只是装作救人，实则把我们耍得团团转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>但他不是那样的。他为了使我相信，还使用了一种神秘术，就像是……读我的骨头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-619914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-308217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>您能想象吗？他靠从我骨头上获取的信息，说出了我自己都不确定的事。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "NS-15"}}